{
  "title": { "zh": "给扫描台装上频率刻度", "en": "Add a frequency scale" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "扫描器已经能处理局部变化，但规则条纹可能遍布整幅图，靠局部平滑还会损失有用细节。这章要造频率分析仪，先构造能与条纹比较的波形。负值表示围绕零的变化，计算会完整保留。 <wiki-ref to=\"wave-parameters\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "The scanner handles local changes, but periodic stripes span the image and local smoothing may remove useful detail. Build a frequency analyser, beginning with waves to compare against stripes. Negative readings represent variation around zero and remain intact in computations. <wiki-ref to=\"wave-parameters\"></wiki-ref>"
      },
      "fig": "frequency-wave"
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "\\[s[n]=A\\cos\\!\\left(2\\pi\\left(\\frac{kn}{N}+p\\right)\\right)\\]\n\nn=0,…,N−1 是行内位置，k 是整行的周期数，p 是以周为单位的相位，A 是峰值幅度。改变 k 会改变重复次数；改变 p 会平移波形的排列。p 增加 1/4 周就是转过 π/2 弧度。 <wiki-ref to=\"wave-parameters\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "\\[s[n]=A\\cos\\!\\left(2\\pi\\left(\\frac{kn}{N}+p\\right)\\right)\\]\n\nn=0,…,N−1 indexes a row, k counts cycles across it, p is phase in turns and A is peak amplitude. Changing k changes repetitions; changing p shifts the alignment. A quarter turn is π/2 radians. <wiki-ref to=\"wave-parameters\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v2_cycle",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "先保持一个周期",
        "en": "Keep one cycle first"
      },
      "adds": ["cosine"],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "整行长度表示 1 周，先只产生一个周期。按照给定相位改变起点，不改变周期数；保留波形的正负读数。余弦元件自动计算角度对应的读数。",
        "en": "The row length represents one turn. Produce one cycle while changing its starting phase, without changing cycle count. Retain signed values; cosine computes the readings automatically."
      },
      "after": {
        "zh": "\\[\\theta=2\\pi p,\\qquad s=\\cos\\theta\\]\n\np 用“周”表示一个周期中的位置，θ 是同一位置的弧度角。p=0 与 p=1 回到同一点；p 增加 1/4 周就转过直角，说明相位可以改变读数而不改变频率。 <wiki-ref to=\"wave-parameters\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "\\[\\theta=2\\pi p,\\qquad s=\\cos\\theta\\]\n\np measures position in turns and θ in radians. p=0 and p=1 return to the same point; adding a quarter turn rotates by a right angle. Phase can therefore alter a reading without changing frequency. <wiki-ref to=\"wave-parameters\"></wiki-ref>"
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "position", "label": { "zh": "归一化位置", "en": "Normalised position" } },
        { "name": "phase", "label": { "zh": "相位（周）", "en": "Phase (turns)" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [{ "name": "out", "label": { "zh": "单周期读数", "en": "Single-cycle readings" } }],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "position": [[0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75]],
            "phase": 0
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [
                1,
                6.123233995736766e-17,
                -1,
                -1.8369701987210297e-16
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "position": [[0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75]],
            "phase": 0.25
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [
                6.123233995736766e-17,
                -1,
                -1.8369701987210297e-16,
                1
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "position": [[0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75]], "phase": 1 },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [
                1,
                3.061616997868383e-16,
                -1,
                -4.286263797015736e-16
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [],
      "solution": [
        "a = arithmetic[op=add](position,phase)",
        "v = cosine(a)",
        "out <- v"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "v = cosine(position)",
        "out <- v"
      ],
      "views": { "grid": ["plot", "numbers", "pixels"] },
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "相位改变同一周期的起点。完全忽略相位会让不同起点得到同一张表；增加整整一周则应回到原来的读数。",
        "en": "Phase changes where a cycle starts. Ignoring it makes different starting phases identical; adding one complete turn should restore the original readings."
      },
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": {
            "zh": "频率分析先需要一把可重复的刻度。余弦元件以“周”为角度单位，1 周回到同一读数，四分之一周与半周落在不同位置；数值由元件计算。先只改变起点，观察波形在周期内怎样排列。 <wiki-ref to=\"wave-parameters\"></wiki-ref>",
            "en": "Frequency analysis needs a repeatable basis. Cosine takes turns: one turn returns to the same reading, while quarter and half turns occupy different positions. The component computes values. First change the starting phase and inspect arrangement within one cycle. <wiki-ref to=\"wave-parameters\"></wiki-ref>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "相位是所有位置共同的角度偏移；比较四分之一周和整整一周，不需要手算三角函数。",
          "en": "Phase is a shared angular offset. Compare a quarter turn with a full turn; no trigonometric calculation is required."
        }
      ],
      "sample": {
        "inputs": {
