    {
      "id": "v2_wave",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "造波形",
        "en": "Build a wave"
      },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "位置以整行长度为 1，频率是整行的周期数，相位以周计。造一个能够随频率和相位变化的单位幅度余弦波。",
        "en": "Positions span one row length; frequency is cycles per row and phase is in turns. Build a unit-amplitude cosine wave that responds to frequency and phase."
      },
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": {
            "zh": "单周期的相位变化已经验证。现在把整行的周期数也作为输入：它改变位置刻度走过的圈数，相位仍负责共同的角度偏移。用 0、1 和多个周期区分间距与起点。 <wiki-ref to=\"wave-parameters\"></wiki-ref>",
            "en": "Single-cycle phase shifts are verified. Now accept cycles per row as an input: it changes how many turns the position scale traverses, while phase remains a shared offset. Compare zero, one and multiple cycles to distinguish spacing from starting phase. <wiki-ref to=\"wave-parameters\"></wiki-ref>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "position", "label": { "zh": "归一化位置", "en": "Normalised position" } },
        { "name": "frequency", "label": { "zh": "周期数", "en": "Cycles per row" } },
        { "name": "phase", "label": { "zh": "相位（周）", "en": "Phase (turns)" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [{ "name": "out", "label": { "zh": "基波读数", "en": "Basis readings" } }],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "position": [[0, 0.125, 0.25, 0.375, 0.5, 0.625, 0.75, 0.875]],
            "frequency": 1,
            "phase": 0
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [
                1,
                0.7071067811865476,
                6.123233995736766e-17,
                -0.7071067811865475,
                -1,
                -0.7071067811865477,
                -1.8369701987210297e-16,
                0.7071067811865474
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "position": [[0, 0.125, 0.25, 0.375, 0.5, 0.625, 0.75, 0.875]],
            "frequency": 2,
            "phase": 0.25
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [
                6.123233995736766e-17,
                -1,
                -1.8369701987210297e-16,
                1,
                3.061616997868383e-16,
                -1,
                -4.286263797015736e-16,
                1
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "position": [[0, 0.2, 0.4, 0.6, 0.8]], "frequency": 0, "phase": 0.125 },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [
                0.7071067811865476,
                0.7071067811865476,
                0.7071067811865476,
                0.7071067811865476,
                0.7071067811865476
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "position": [
              [0, 0.16666666666666666, 0.3333333333333333, 0.5, 0.6666666666666666, 0.8333333333333334]
            ],
            "frequency": 2,
            "phase": -0.25
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [
                6.123233995736766e-17,
                0.8660254037844387,
                -0.8660254037844385,
                -1.8369701987210297e-16,
                0.866025403784439,
                -0.8660254037844388
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "speed = arithmetic[op=mul](position,frequency)",
        "angle = arithmetic[op=add](speed,phase)",
        "v = cosine(angle)",
        "out <- v"
      ],
      "views": { "grid": ["plot", "numbers", "pixels"] },
      "starter": [
        "a = arithmetic[op=add](position,phase)",
        "v = cosine(a)",
        "out <- v"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "speed = arithmetic[op=add](position,frequency)",
        "angle = arithmetic[op=add](speed,phase)",
        "v = cosine(angle)",
        "out <- v"
      ],
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "频率改变单位长度内转过的周期数，不是把所有位置一起平移。相位才负责共同的角度偏移。",
        "en": "Frequency changes cycles across the row; it is not a common position shift. Phase supplies the common angular offset."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "先固定相位比较不同周期数，再固定周期数比较不同相位。余弦元件自动完成三角函数计算。",
          "en": "Hold phase fixed to compare cycle counts, then hold frequency fixed to compare phases. Cosine supplies the arithmetic."
        }
      ],
